{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51873","headline":"却鬼丸 · 无名氏","name":"却鬼丸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"走鹿枯风吼夜阑，颂花还喜向椒盘。\n人情此日非前日，岁事新官对旧官。\n竹[叶]（里）莫辞终日醉，梅花已拚隔年看。\n书生但恐寒爲祟，不用朱泥却鬼丹。\n（《岁时广记》五《元旦》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}